{"id":"6c23c06c4d297e8d","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-subobject-fibration.md","title":"子对象纤维化","display":"df-subobject-fibration — 子对象纤维化","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-subobject-fibration","display":"df-subobject-fibration — 子对象纤维化","depends_on":["[[16-df-pullback-square]]","[[16-df-slice-category]]","[[16-df-split-fibration]]","[[16-df-fibred-preorder]]"],"source":"§1.3 p.43 (PDF63); Proposition1.1.6(ii) p.28 (PDF48); Example3.4.4(ii) p.193 (PDF213)","revision_date":"2026-10-19","aliases":["16-df-subobject-fibration"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-subobject-fibration"},{"key":"display","html":"df-subobject-fibration — 子对象纤维化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0cd12b341f6289c0\" href=\"?note=0cd12b341f6289c0\" title=\"16-df-slice-category\">16-df-slice-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" href=\"?note=eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" title=\"16-df-split-fibration\">16-df-split-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" href=\"?note=ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" title=\"16-df-fibred-preorder\">16-df-fibred-preorder</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§1.3 p.43 (PDF63); Proposition1.1.6(ii) p.28 (PDF48); Example3.4.4(ii) p.193 (PDF213)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-19"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-subobject-fibration</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B=\\langle O_{\\mathcal B},M_{\\mathcal B},s_{\\mathcal B},t_{\\mathcal B},e_{\\mathcal B},c_{\\mathcal B}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal B=\\langle O_{\\mathcal B},M_{\\mathcal B},s_{\\mathcal B},t_{\\mathcal B},e_{\\mathcal B},c_{\\mathcal B}\\rangle\\)</span> 为具有拉回的范畴；单态射、同构、拉回方块采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a>，切片范畴见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0cd12b341f6289c0\" href=\"?note=0cd12b341f6289c0\" title=\"16-df-slice-category\">16-df-slice-category</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,J,K\\in O_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(I,J,K\\in O_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in M_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(m,n\\in M_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span> 为候选箭头，各公式使用时的余域及单态条件由下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_I,P_J\">\\(P_I,P_J\\)</span> 指定，源对象由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(s_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span> 取得，不固定为某个自由对象。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_I\">\\(\\sim_I\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_I\">\\(\\le_I\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal B}(I)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal B}(I)\\)</span> 在下节构造；同一纤维内的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le\">\\(\\le\\)</span> 简写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_I\">\\(\\le_I\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal B},\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B},\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal B},\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B},\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}\\)</span> 仅为本页构造的对象集、箭头集及结构映射的固定标签，不另表示一个未定义的谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>总箭头携带源靶标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle(I,S),(J,T),u\\rangle\">\\(\\langle(I,S),(J,T),u\\rangle\\)</span>；仅在固定Hom中简写为基箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 本身是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 的完整箭头记录；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\">\\(S,T\\)</span> 为子对象同构类。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span> 沿 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0cd12b341f6289c0\" href=\"?note=0cd12b341f6289c0\" title=\"16-df-slice-category\">16-df-slice-category</a> 的同一编码使用；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 是末式给出的提升族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitFib}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibPre}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibPre}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" href=\"?note=eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" title=\"16-df-split-fibration\">16-df-split-fibration</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" href=\"?note=ddfda06bbcc2ec7b\" title=\"16-df-fibred-preorder\">16-df-fibred-preorder</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nP_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{m\\in M_{\\mathcal B}\\mid t_{\\mathcal B}(m)=I\\land\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal B}(m)\\},\\\\\nm\\sim_I n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow m,n\\in P_I\\land\n(\\exists h\\in\\mathcal B(s_{\\mathcal B}(m),s_{\\mathcal B}(n)))\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}(h)\\land nh=m,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal B}(I)&amp;\\coloneqq P_I/{\\sim_I},\\\\\n\\le_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{([m],[n])\\mid m,n\\in P_I\\land\n(\\exists h\\in\\mathcal B(s_{\\mathcal B}(m),s_{\\mathcal B}(n)))\\ nh=m\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nP_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{m\\in M_{\\mathcal B}\\mid t_{\\mathcal B}(m)=I\\land\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal B}(m)\\},\\\\\nm\\sim_I n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow m,n\\in P_I\\land\n(\\exists h\\in\\mathcal B(s_{\\mathcal B}(m),s_{\\mathcal B}(n)))\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B}(h)\\land nh=m,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal B}(I)&amp;\\coloneqq P_I/{\\sim_I},\\\\\n\\le_I&amp;\\coloneqq\\{([m],[n])\\mid m,n\\in P_I\\land\n(\\exists h\\in\\mathcal B(s_{\\mathcal B}(m),s_{\\mathcal B}(n)))\\ nh=m\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{u^*[n]\\}\\coloneqq\\{[m]\\mid m\\in P_I\\land\n(\\exists h\\in\\mathcal B(s_{\\mathcal B}(m),s_{\\mathcal B}(n)))\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(h,m;n,u)\\}\n\\quad(u\\in\\mathcal B(I,J),\\ n\\in P_J).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{u^*[n]\\}\\coloneqq\\{[m]\\mid m\\in P_I\\land\n(\\exists h\\in\\mathcal B(s_{\\mathcal B}(m),s_{\\mathcal B}(n)))\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(h,m;n,u)\\}\n\\quad(u\\in\\mathcal B(I,J),\\ n\\in P_J).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO_{\\mathrm{Sub}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(I,S)\\mid I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\land S\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal B}(I)\\},\\\\\nM_{\\mathrm{Sub}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle(I,S),(J,T),u\\rangle\\mid\n(I,S),(J,T)\\in O_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\\land u\\in\\mathcal B(I,J)\\land S\\le u^*T\\},\\\\\ns_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\\langle(I,S),(J,T),u\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq(I,S),\\\\\nt_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\\langle(I,S),(J,T),u\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq(J,T),\\\\\ne_{\\mathrm{Sub}}(I,S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(I,S),(I,S),\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle,\\\\\nc_{\\mathrm{Sub}}(\\langle(J,T),(K,V),v\\rangle,\\langle(I,S),(J,T),u\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(I,S),(K,V),vu\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathcal B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_{\\mathrm{Sub}},M_{\\mathrm{Sub}},s_{\\mathrm{Sub}},t_{\\mathrm{Sub}},e_{\\mathrm{Sub}},c_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\\rangle,\\\\\np_0(I,S)&amp;\\coloneqq I,\\\\\np_1\\langle(I,S),(J,T),u\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq u,\\\\\np&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle p_0,p_1\\rangle,\\qquad p_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\\coloneqq p.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO_{\\mathrm{Sub}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(I,S)\\mid I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\land S\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal B}(I)\\},\\\\\nM_{\\mathrm{Sub}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle(I,S),(J,T),u\\rangle\\mid\n(I,S),(J,T)\\in O_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\\land u\\in\\mathcal B(I,J)\\land S\\le u^*T\\},\\\\\ns_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\\langle(I,S),(J,T),u\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq(I,S),\\\\\nt_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\\langle(I,S),(J,T),u\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq(J,T),\\\\\ne_{\\mathrm{Sub}}(I,S)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(I,S),(I,S),\\operatorname{id}_I\\rangle,\\\\\nc_{\\mathrm{Sub}}(\\langle(J,T),(K,V),v\\rangle,\\langle(I,S),(J,T),u\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(I,S),(K,V),vu\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathcal B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_{\\mathrm{Sub}},M_{\\mathrm{Sub}},s_{\\mathrm{Sub}},t_{\\mathrm{Sub}},e_{\\mathrm{Sub}},c_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\\rangle,\\\\\np_0(I,S)&amp;\\coloneqq I,\\\\\np_1\\langle(I,S),(J,T),u\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq u,\\\\\np&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle p_0,p_1\\rangle,\\qquad p_{\\mathrm{Sub}}\\coloneqq p.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\kappa(u,(J,T))&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(I,u^*T),(J,T),u\\rangle\n\\quad(u\\in\\mathcal B(I,J)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathcal B))&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(p,\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathcal B),\\mathcal B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{FibPre}(p).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\kappa(u,(J,T))&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(I,u^*T),(J,T),u\\rangle\n\\quad(u\\in\\mathcal B(I,J)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathcal B))&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(p,\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathcal B),\\mathcal B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{FibPre}(p).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_I\">\\(P_I\\)</span> 遍历余域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 的全部单态射，其源随箭头变化；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_I\">\\(\\sim_I\\)</span> 是源同构关系。单态射的因子至多唯一；双向因子复合后由单态性为恒等，所以商上的因子序反对称。</li>\n<li>换基通过单元素集合定义所需的子对象类，不预选拉回对象或某条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*n\">\\(u^*n\\)</span> 箭头。拉回存在且单态射在拉回下保持，给右侧至少一个类；两个拉回由泛性质给唯一的保持投影同构，故只有一个类。更换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的等价代表仍给同一类，故这是定义在商上的全函数。恒等拉回与拉回粘贴给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id}^*=\\operatorname{Id}\">\\(\\operatorname{id}^*=\\operatorname{Id}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(vu)^*=u^*v^*\">\\((vu)^*=u^*v^*\\)</span> 的严格等式；沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的规范总箭头为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle(I,u^*T),(J,T),u\\rangle\">\\(\\langle(I,u^*T),(J,T),u\\rangle\\)</span>，其因子唯一性给分裂偏序纤维化。</li>\n<li>若保留所有单态射而不取同构类，则得到等价的预序纤维化，余域投影常也记作 <code>cod</code>。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，§1.3 p.43（PDF63）；Proposition1.1.6(ii) p.28（PDF48）；Example3.4.4(ii) p.193（PDF213）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-slice-category","status":"resolved","id":"0cd12b341f6289c0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-slice-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"eb3d8d8bfc151af6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-split-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-preorder","status":"resolved","id":"ddfda06bbcc2ec7b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibred-preorder]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B=\\langle O_{\\mathcal B},M_{\\mathcal B},s_{\\mathcal B},t_{\\mathcal B},e_{\\mathcal B},c_{\\mathcal B}\\rangle$ 为具有拉回的范畴；单态射、同构、拉回方块采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]，切片范畴见 [[16-df-slice-category]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-slice-category","status":"resolved","id":"0cd12b341f6289c0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B=\\langle O_{\\mathcal B},M_{\\mathcal B},s_{\\mathcal B},t_{\\mathcal B},e_{\\mathcal B},c_{\\mathcal B}\\rangle$ 为具有拉回的范畴；单态射、同构、拉回方块采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]，切片范畴见 [[16-df-slice-category]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Mono}_{\\mathcal B},\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal B},\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-pullback-square]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-slice-category","status":"resolved","id":"0cd12b341f6289c0","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","locat